Subject: [PATCH] build: align CUTLASS DSL with vLLM image

Upstream base: 0332cc5089137753d3af43d1c643516b4350359f

Rationale: Use CUTLASS DSL 4.7.1 to match the vLLM base image.
Quality and speed: Preserves binary compatibility for selected kernels.
Tests: source replay, syntax parse, and diff check; target hardware qualification pending.
Upstream status: local candidate, not submitted.
